&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 0px none #000000; border-top: 0px none #000000; border-right: 0px none #000000; border-bottom: 0px none #000000; width: 298.6px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center; line-height: 1"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;Times New Roman&amp;apos;"&gt;The OneFive Villa Fukuoka&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
